{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/e7d07964054b41625ccec53e7da68b02.poster.avif?t=1757892883\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/e7d07964054b41625ccec53e7da68b02.webm?t=1757892883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/e7d07964054b41625ccec53e7da68b02.mp4?t=1757892883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Odd Jobs on the Lot, you and your friends take on the most overlooked but essential tasks of the car park\u2014return runaway trolleys, clean up rubbish, wash cars, deliver parcels, and load groceries straight into customers\u2019 boots. Sounds simple? Think again. With chaotic physics, time pressure, and unexpected obstacles (like mischievous shoppers and rogue traffic cones), these odd jobs turn into hilarious challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/b44f06a8703952a1705ac8a4c017dcf9.avif?t=1757892883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras_big/b44f06a8703952a1705ac8a4c017dcf9.webp?t=1757892883 width=1560 height=305 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car Park Chaos \u2013 Wrangle trolleys, clean up messes, wash cars, run direct-to-boot deliveries, and even valet park customers\u2019 rides. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op Madness \u2013 Play solo or with 2\u20134 players. Team up (or trip each other up) in physics-powered chaos. Aussie Hazards \u2013 It\u2019s not just the jobs! Dodge swooping magpies, bin-raiding ibis, boxing kangaroos, wild storms, hail, bushfire smoke, and even burst hydrants flooding the lot. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles &amp; Deliveries \u2013 Hop in drivable vehicles, complete parcel runs, and race the clock with time-sensitive missions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customisable Animal Workers \u2013 Choose from Aussie and international animals, deck them out in wacky outfits, and bring your own style to the lot. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True-Blue Aussie Flavour \u2013 From beachside markets to suburban shopping centres, every level captures a slice of chaotic Aussie life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/d30f5c992a8e686f9a1302509d275c00.poster.avif?t=1757892883\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/d30f5c992a8e686f9a1302509d275c00.webm?t=1757892883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/d30f5c992a8e686f9a1302509d275c00.mp4?t=1757892883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From rounding up stray trolleys to washing cars, cleaning rubbish, running direct-to-boot deliveries, and even valet parking, there\u2019s always another quirky task waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/7fa96edfb8a3c175bdcbc6f35ce9d0a8.avif?t=1757892883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras_big/7fa96edfb8a3c175bdcbc6f35ce9d0a8.webp?t=1757892883 width=1560 height=305 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work Together (Or Else) \u2013 Teamwork is the only way to survive the shift! Split tasks or coordinate closely to finish jobs on time. Miss the deadline and your pay gets docked\u2014leaving the crew scrambling to make ends meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/8fbced050c77389f16720c9fd2821930.poster.avif?t=1757892883\" width=1536 height=588 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/8fbced050c77389f16720c9fd2821930.webm?t=1757892883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/8fbced050c77389f16720c9fd2821930.mp4?t=1757892883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally scored soundtrack featuring jazz, rock, and beats by award-winning Epoch Music composers\u2014bringing energy and style to every shift!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With special thanks going to\u00a0Dark Half Studios for trailer and in game audio!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/e7f7006b571cae3c413dee142b866b5b.poster.avif?t=1757892883\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/e7f7006b571cae3c413dee142b866b5b.webm?t=1757892883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/e7f7006b571cae3c413dee142b866b5b.mp4?t=1757892883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re playing alone or laughing with friends, Odd Jobs on the Lot turns everyday errands into a slapstick adventure of teamwork, timing, and trolley wrangling.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826040?t=1757892883","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826040?t=1757892883","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/5bb856aa9860814babedde1bc4c08aca0b84dc2a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757892883","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/5bb856aa9860814babedde1bc4c08aca0b84dc2a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757892883","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/e7d07964054b41625ccec53e7da68b02.poster.avif?t=1757892883\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/e7d07964054b41625ccec53e7da68b02.webm?t=1757892883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826040/extras/e7d07964054b41625ccec53e7da68b02.mp4?t=1757892883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Odd Jobs on the Lot, you and your friends take on the most overlooked but essential tasks of the car park\u2014return runaway trolleys, clean up rubbish, wash cars, deliver parcels, and load groceries straight